ardTab__yaTHJ ProductAwards__active__9TvSy\">\n          All\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Giải thưởng\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-awards\" id=\"Giải_thưởng\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(12)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202108101554071430956.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Coup de Coeur\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Cowcotland\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Coup de Coeur</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX is truly impressive. It can even seem intimidating with its multitude of buttons and functions. Using this card was a real pleasure.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>07/19/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of Coup de Coeur\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.cowcotland.com/articles/3920/test-carte-mere-asus-rog-maximus-z790-apex-l-oc-c-est-sa-specialite.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202012141742109790830.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Coup de Coeur\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Overclocking.com\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Coup de Coeur</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If you want to take full advantage of DDR5 overclocking or if you plan to switch to LN2, then this is the card you need and not another one! [...]\nThis ROG Maximus Z790 APEX has finally reached full maturity in terms of its PCB but also and above all thanks to the great team behind the design and BIOS patching that is doing an awesome job.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>12/02/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of Coup de Coeur\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://overclocking.com/test-rog-maximus-z790-apex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001092249208200773.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techtesters.eu\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      For the extreme OC target group, this is “the” board and our top choice…\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>03/27/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techtesters.eu/asus-z790-roundup/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202105251537500690693.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"A personal favourite of ours \" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techgaming.nl\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>A personal favourite of ours </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      What a damn nice motherboard.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>11/10/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of A personal favourite of ours \" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://techgaming.nl/asus-rog-maximus-z790-apex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1302/202009250038589810457.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Pokdeward Silver\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Pokde\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Pokdeward Silver</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      If the sole purpose of your next motherboard purchase is to get into extreme overclocking or trying to break world records, the ASUS ROG Maximus Z790 APEX is likely your next weapon of choice.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>MALAYSIA</span> <span>05/29/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of Pokdeward Silver\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://pokde.net/review/asus-rog-maximus-z790-apex-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1349/201912241723339250852.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"performance first\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      XFastest\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>performance first</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS and Intel announced a new processor overclocking record a few days ago, overclocking Intel's 13th generation Core i9-13900K processor to 9.008GHz, and the motherboard used to set this record is the ROG Maximus Z790 APEX designed for overclocking. The built-in display output is canceled, and 24+0 phase power supply is provided. The 2-slot memory can also support high-clock overclocking. In addition, many convenient switches are provided for overclocking needs.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>TAIWAN</span> <span>02/27/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of performance first\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.xfastest.com/thread-272639-1-1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202002241500381010968.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"HKEPC Editor's Choice\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HKEPC\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>HKEPC Editor's Choice</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX adapted really strong power design and vrm cooling which can provide stable and strong efficiency\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>11/04/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of HKEPC Editor's Choice\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hkepc.com/21220/%E9%8A%80%E7%99%BD%E8%89%B2_PCB__%E8%B6%85%E9%A0%BB%E6%9D%BF%E7%9A%87_ASUS_ROG_MAXIMUS_Z790_APEX_%E4%B8%BB%E6%A9%9F%E6%9D%BF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202009042235216900101.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"DD Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.ddworld.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>DD Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It's definitely not a dime a dozen, and that's what you're paying for, too. But you're mainly paying for the OC potential, when world records for Intel CPU clocks and this platform in general are actually falling on this board. So if you are interested in the field of &quot;OC sports&quot;, ASUS ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX is quite possibly the TOP motherboard for you, because this is not really a normal motherboard, it is more of a tool or sports equipment for overclockers. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>06/20/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG MAXIMUS Z790 APEX Media review Award of DD Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"http://www.ddworld.cz/pc-a-komponenty/zakladni-desky/asus-rog-maximus-z790-apex-test-a-recenze-zakladni-desky-pro-oc-sportovani-a-rekordy-5-2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__rewardMoreButton__NCAU7\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeA